    },
    "body": "After protected #2318 delivery, the harness registry still reported M2 count8 and named the head, shared writer and full rung0 path as unfinished. Reconcile that cache with the verified source/FIT delivery, remove only Codex's released complete-path claim, and record the actual merge/source/tree proof. All peer claims and history remain.\n\nLine: unified geometric route/action/learning integration · Count:11/3 (previous10/3) · Headline:M1 reply37/232 unchanged; M2 saved437/512 →437/512, opened0/128 unchanged; fresh NOT_RUN · Decision:KEEP records, no model promotion. No headline reset: projection8, head9, complete path10, this cache reconciliation11.\n\nPivot recorded: owner-directed native geometric replacement and complete-path review, already delivered in #2318 at5b22739a31eafb131d25e098bb7f02ab803d4fe7; this correction reconciles stale tooling records with that delivery, introduces no repeated experiment or new mechanism.\nPrereg:#issuecomment-6140707742 — TEST FITNESS:FIT for the exact corrected rung0 sheet, prospectively recorded; global training and separate M2 training/rental remain HELD. No compute authorization follows.\n\nValidation:JSON parsing, claim-wording gate, diff whitespace and scoped exact-source/tree checks PASS. No Rust model path changes; all crates/uor-r4-training byte-equal qualified05c84bece and delivered5b22739a. Eighteen finite controls remain evidence at that source only; optimizer update, training, CPU model reference, corpus/quality run NOT_RUN. Local metadata cost only, no new paid work.\n\nCanonical record:docs/labs/rung0-complete-path-2026-10-13/README.md plus newest current-state entry; STATUS/ROADMAP and harness M1/M2 next fields reconciled. Full M2 and D11 remain unqualified. References #2028, #2029, #2030.\n\n- [x] Checks run at this exact head\n- `python3 -m json.tool docs/harness/milestones.json` PASS\n- `python3 -m json.tool docs/harness/claims.json` PASS\n- `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` PASS\n- `git diff --check` PASS\n- `git diff --exit-code 05c84bece HEAD -- crates/uor-r4-training` PASS (empty)\n",
